{"articleNo":"333847","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=333847&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [KIT Engineering Fair 2021] 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.11.11","hit":"48241","attachments":[{"name":"KIT Engineering Fair 2021 참가자 및 관람자 방역 수칙.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=333847&attachNo=106322"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18pt;\">년도 대·내외 재정지원사업을 통해 완성된 캡스톤 디자인의 결과물을 전시하여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18pt;\">우리 대학 학생들의&nbsp;창의적 아이디어를 공유하고 우수작품 포상을 통해 자긍심을 고취하기 위하여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">&nbsp;「&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\">KIT Engineering Fair 2021 」</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18pt;\">을 개최하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">, 교내 구성원</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18pt;\">들의 많은 참여 및 참관&nbsp;부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">전시일정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">개막식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">: 2021. 12. 9.(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">) 11:00 ~ 12:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">시상식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">: 2021. 12. 10.(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">) 14:00 ~ 15:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp; 다.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">전시기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">: 2021. 12. 9.(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">) 10:00 ~ 17:00 /</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;12. 10.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) 10:00 ~ 15:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; 라.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">경품추첨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">: 2021. 12. 10.(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">이후 별도 진행</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">밀집도를 완화를 위해 경품 추첨은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">Fair</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">개최 이후 별도로 진행되며 경품 추첨결과는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">13</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">일 이후 홈페이지에 게시될 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">당첨자는 응모권과 학생증을 소지하고 안내된 기간 내에 공학교육혁신센터로 방문하여 경품 수령하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">금오공과대학교 체육관</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">에어 팟</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">갤럭시 버즈</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">애플워치</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">등 많은 경품이 준비될 예정이니 학생들의 적극적인 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;(경품종류는 행사 진행상황에 따라 변동 될 수 있음)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">3. 참관시 유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\"><b><span style=\"text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">접종증명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.3pt; font-family: &quot;HCI Poppy&quot;; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">· </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">음성확인제&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </span></b><span style=\"text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">도입</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">에 따라 참가 또는 관람 시</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;\">코로나19 백신</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"> '접종완료자(접종완료 후 14일 경과)'</span></b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"> 및 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">'방역수칙상 인정되는자'</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt;\">만&nbsp;</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">입장 가능하며 그 외에는&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; text-indent: -18.3pt;\">입장이 제한됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; text-indent: -18.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(상세내용은 첨부파일 </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">'KIT Engineering Fair 2021</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><b style=\"font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; text-indent: -18.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">참가자 및 관람자 방역 수칙'</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; text-indent: -18.3pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"> 참조)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.3pt; text-indent: -18.3pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:14.0pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:14.0pt;\">문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-